- **What**: `scripts/GrassField.cs` + `scripts/GrassInteractor.cs` — an
  interactive grass system recreating the feature set of Unity's "A+ Grass"
  asset natively in Godot (no asset code used; Unity/URP shaders can't port):
  60k MultiMesh crossed-quad blades (1 draw call), two-layer scrolling wind
  noise with blend uniform, base→tip gradient + per-blade jitter + patch noise
