    `mod(y, FloorHeight)` wainscot band)
  - Stair walls → "Parquet panel" (`GetStairStoneMat`)
  - Arena wall behind bookshelves → "Wooden Panels" (StandardMaterial3D
    triplanar); dome-fade base tone warmed to match
- **Curtains**: huge deep-red velvet curtains over both arena arch doorways
  (cover the black corridor openings). Shader-cloth: pinned rod, drape
  scallops, two-layer wind ripple, and bulge/part around nearby
  GrassInteractors via per-frame push uniforms (`ArenaBuilder._PhysicsProcess`).
- **CRITICAL DISCOVERY — Jolt vs SoftBody3D**: this project uses Jolt
  (`physics_engine="Jolt Physics"`), and real SoftBody3D cloth SHREDS under
  Jolt in Godot 4.6 even with a properly welded indexed mesh (verified
  verts=221/indices=1152 and position-based pinning). Do NOT use SoftBody3D
  in this project; use shader-cloth instead.
  Also: SurfaceTool.GenerateNormals() DEINDEXES surfaces — never call it on a
  mesh intended for soft-body/welded use; set normals manually.
- **BlenderKit addon note**: installed 3.21 has a server API version-skew bug
  (`UserProfile got unexpected 'avatar512'`) breaking ALL downloads; worked
  around by monkeypatching tolerant dataclass constructors in-session. Addon
  should be updated. Accidental 68MB addon-source copy deleted from
